<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Kolosyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">KOLOSYEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLOSYEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Paul, yon apot Jésus Kri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:1">I Kor 1:1</ref></char></note>pa volonte a Bondye, ak Timothée, frè nou an <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />A sen ak frè fidèl an Kris ki te Colosse yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Gras pou nou, ak lapè ki soti nan Bondye, Papa nou an.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou bay remèsiman a Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:6">Wo 15:6</ref></char></note>Papa a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri; pandan nou toujou ap priye pou nou. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:15">Ef 1:15</ref></char></note>Paske nou te tande de lafwa nou nan Kris Jésus, ansanm ak lanmou ke nou gen pou tout fidèl yo; <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Akoz de lespwa ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:8">II Tim 4:8</ref></char></note>rezève pou nou nan syèl la, jan nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:13">Ef 1:13</ref></char></note>tande deja nan pawòl verite Levanjil la, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />ki te vini a nou menm, jis menm jan nan tou mond lan, k ap bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Wo 1:13</ref></char></note>fwi tout tan, e k ap ogmante, menm jan li t ap fèt nan nou menm tou, depi jou nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:21">Ef 4:21</ref></char></note>tande de li a, e te konprann gras Bondye nan verite a; <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />menm jan ke nou te aprann de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kol 4:12</ref></char></note>Épaphras, sèvitè-atache, byeneme, parèy a nou an, ki se yon sèvitè fidèl an Kris sou pati pa nou, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />ki te osi enfòme nou de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:30">Wo 15:30</ref></char></note>lanmou nou nan Lespri a.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Pou rezon sa a tou, depi jou nou te tande de li a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:16">Ef 1:16</ref></char></note>nou pa t sispann priye pou nou e mande pou nou ta kapab ranpli avèk konesans a volonte Li, nan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:17">Ef 1:17</ref></char></note>sajès lespri a ak bon konprann, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ef 4:1</ref></char></note>mache nan yon fason dign de Senyè a, pou fè Li plezi nan tout bagay, pote fwi nan tout bon zèv e grandi nan konesans a Bondye, <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />ki ranfòse ak tout pouvwa, selon pwisans laglwa Li a, pou vin genyen pèseverans ak pasyans; avèk lajwa, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />pou bay remèsiman a Papa a, ki te kalifye nou pou pataje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:32">Trav 20:32</ref></char></note>nan eritaj a fidèl yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:18">Trav 26:18</ref></char></note>Limyè a. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Paske Li te delivre nou soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:12">Ef 6:12</ref></char></note>wayòm tenèb la, e Li te transfere nou nan wayòm a Fis byeneme Li a. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:24">Wo 3:24</ref></char></note>Nan Li menm nou gen redanmsyon, ak padon pou peche yo.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Li se imaj a Bondye envizib la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>premye ne a tout kreyasyon an. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Paske pa Li menm, tout bagay te kreye, nan syèl la ak sou tè a, vizib e envizib kit se wayòm yo, kit se pouvwa yo, kit se wa yo, kit se otorite yo—<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jn 1:3</ref></char></note>tout bagay te kreye pa Li menm e pou Li menm. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref></char></note>avan tout bagay, e se nan Li tout bagay kenbe ansanm. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Li se osi tèt a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ef 1:23</ref></char></note>kò a legliz la. Epi Li se kòmansman an, premye ne ki sòti nan lanmò a, pou Li menm kapab vin gen premye plas nan tout bagay. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Paske se te bon plezi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:5">Ef 1:5</ref></char></note>Papa a pou tout plenitud Bondye a ta vin rete nan Li, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />epi selon Li menm, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:18">II Kor 5:18</ref></char></note>rekonsilye tout bagay a Li menm, kit bagay ki sou latè yo kit bagay ki nan syèl yo, lè L te fin fè lapè pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:13">Ef 2:13</ref></char></note>san lakwa Li a.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Epi menmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:10">Wo 5:10</ref></char></note>otrefwa, nou te etranje, e te lènmi nan jan nou te konn panse, ak angaje nan move zak, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />men koulye a Li rekonsilye nou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:4">Wo 7:4</ref></char></note>kò lachè Li a atravè lanmò, pou prezante nou devan Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:4">Ef 1:4</ref></char></note>sen, san fot e san repwòch— <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Si vrèman nou kontinye nan lafwa byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:17">Ef 3:17</ref></char></note>etabli, e fèm, e nou pa kite esperans levanjil ke nou te tande a, ki te pwoklame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:5">Trav 2:5</ref></char></note>nan tout kreyasyon anba syèl la, e sou li menm mwen, Paul, te fèt kòm yon sèvitè.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Alò, mwen rejwi nan soufrans mwen yo pou koz a nou, e nan lachè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:8">II Tim 1:8</ref></char></note>mwen fè pati pa m pou benefis kò Li a, ki se legliz la, pou ranpli sa ki manke nan soufrans lafliksyon a Kris yo. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Sou legliz sila a mwen te fèt kòm yon sèvitè selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:2">Ef 3:2</ref></char></note>jesyon Bondye a, ki te plase sou mwen pou benefis pa nou, pou m ta kapab vin akonpli predikasyon pawòl Bondye a, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Wo 16:25</ref></char></note>ki se mistè ki te kache depi laj ak jenerasyon pase yo, men ki koulye a, manifeste a fidèl Li yo. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />A yo menm Bondye te gen volonte pou fè konnen kisa ki se richès laglwa a mistè sila a pami pèp etranje yo, ki se Kris nan nou, esperans laglwa a. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Konsa nou pwoklame Li ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">I Kor 3:16</ref></char></note>egzòtasyon chak moun, e enstwi chak moun ak tout sajès, pou nou kapab prezante chak moun konplè an Kris Jésus. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Pou rezon sila a osi, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:10">I Kor 15:10</ref></char></note>travay, e mwen lite pa ajans Bondye, k ap travay avèk pwisans nan mwen an.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Paske mwen vle fè nou konnen jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:29">Kol 1:29</ref></char></note>lit la gran pou nou menm ansanm ak sila ki Laodicée yo, e menm pou tout sila ki pa t, pèsonèlman, wè figi mwen yo; <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:22">Ef 6:22</ref></char></note>kè pa yo kapab ankouraje, akoz ke yo vin trese ansanm nan lanmou an. Se konsa yo atenn tout richès ki sòti nan asirans konplè a bon konprann nan, ki pwodwi kòm rezilta, vrè konesans mistè Bondye a, ki se Kris la, Li menm. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Nan Li menm kache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:2">És 11:2</ref></char></note>tout trezò sajès ak konesans yo. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Mwen di sa pou pèsòn pa twonpe nou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:18">Wo 16:18</ref></char></note>diskou ki kab sedwi moun. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Paske menm si mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:3">I Kor 5:3</ref></char></note>absan nan kò a, malgre sa mwen avèk nou nan Lespri a, epi m ap rejwi pou wè bon disiplin ak stabilite lafwa nou nan Kris la.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Konsa, menm jan nou te resevwa Kris Jésus Senyè a, se konsa pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:10">Kol 1:10</ref></char></note>mache nan Li. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Menm jan ke nou te byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:17">Ef 3:17</ref></char></note>anrasine e kounye a, nou byen bati nan Li, e etabli nan lafwa nou, menm jan nou te enstwi a, plenn avèk remèsiman an.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Veye ke pèsòn pa fè nou prizonye atravè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ef 5:6</ref></char></note>filosofi ak fo manèv, pa tradisyon a lòm yo, nan prensip de baz mond lan, olye de pa Kris. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Paske nan Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:19">II Kor 5:19</ref></char></note>tout aspè konplè a Bondye a egziste nan fòm a yon kò fizik. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Epi nan Li menm nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:19">Ef 3:19</ref></char></note>konplè nèt, paske se Li menm ki chèf an tèt sou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:24">I Kor 15:24</ref></char></note>wayòm ak otorite yo. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Konsa, nan Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Wo 2:29</ref></char></note>nou te sikonsi avèk yon sikonsizyon ki fèt san men, ki retire kò lachè a pa sikonsizyon a Kris la. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Wo 6:4</ref></char></note>antere avèk Li nan batèm nan. Nan li menm, nou te anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:6">Ef 2:6</ref></char></note>resisite avèk Li pa lafwa kon yon zèv Bondye, ki te leve Li sòti nan lanmò a. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Lè nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1">Ef 2:1</ref></char></note>mouri nan transgresyon nou yo ak nan ensikonsizyon lachè nou an, Li te fè nou vivan ansanm avèk Li, lè l te padone tout transgresyon nou yo. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Konsa Li te anile <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Ef 2:15</ref></char></note>sètifika dèt nou ki te fòme pa dekrè kont nou yo, ki te parèt kòm lènmi nou. Konsa, Li te mete l sou kote, lè L te kloue li sou kwa a. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Lè Li te fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:8">Ef 4:8</ref></char></note>dezame gouvènè ak otorite yo, Li te fè yo vin afiche piblikman e te triyonfe sou yo pa Li menm.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Konsa, pa kite pèsòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:3">Wo 14:3</ref></char></note>aji kòm jij nou konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:19">Mc 7:19</ref></char></note>manje oubyen bwason, ni respè a yon jou fèt oubyen yon lalin tounèf oubyen yon jou Saba. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Bagay sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:5">Eb 8:5</ref></char></note>lonbraj a sila ki dwe vini an; men vrè sibstans lan apatyen a Kris. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Pa kite pèsòn kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:24">I Kor 9:24</ref></char></note>prive nou de prim nou an pa riz fo imilite ak adorasyon zanj yo, ki baze pozisyon li sou vizyon yo li te fè, ki anfle san rezon ak ògèy pa panse chanèl li, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />ki pa kenbe fèm a Tèt la. Paske se nan Li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ef 1:23</ref></char></note>tout kò a ye a, ki vin founi e kenbe ansanm pa jwenti ak ligaman yo, ki grandi avèk yon kwasans ki sòti nan Bondye.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si nou te mouri avèk Kris a prensip de baz mond yo, poukisa, kòmsi nou t ap viv nan mond lan, nou soumèt nou a kalite dekrè konsa, kòm <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Pa manyen, pa goute, pa touche!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />(Ki tout fè referans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:13">I Kor 6:13</ref></char></note>bagay ki fèt pou peri pandan y ap sèvi yo)—an akò avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">És 29:13</ref></char></note>kòmandman ak enstriksyon a lòm yo? <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Bagay sa yo ki gen, asireman, aparans a sajès nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:18">Kol 2:18</ref></char></note>kwayans relijye ki fèt pou kont li, avèk imilyasyon de li menm, ak move tretman kò a, men ki pa gen okenn valè kont plezi lachè a.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Konsa, si nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref></char></note>leve avèk Kris, chache bagay anwo yo, kote Kris la ye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref></char></note>chita sou men dwat Bondye a. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:23">Mat 16:23</ref></char></note>Fikse panse nou sou bagay anwo yo, pa sou bagay ki sou latè yo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Paske nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:2">Wo 6:2</ref></char></note>mouri, e lavi nou vin kache avèk Kris nan Bondye. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Lè Kris, ki se lavi nou an, vin revele, alò, nou osi va revele avèk Li nan laglwa.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:13">Wo 8:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, konsidere manm kò tèrès nou yo kòm mouri de imoralite, salte, pasyon, move dezi, ak renmen lajan, ki vin menm jan avèk idolatri. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Paske se akoz bagay sa yo ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:18">Wo 1:18</ref></char></note>lakòlè Bondye va vini sou fis a dezobeyisans yo. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ef 2:2</ref></char></note>nan yo, nou tou te konn mache, lè nou t ap viv nan yo. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Men koulye a, nou menm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Ef 4:22</ref></char></note>mete yo tout sou kote; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:31">Ef 4:31</ref></char></note>Move san, kòlè, mechanste, kout lang, ak move jouman ki sòti nan bouch nou. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Ef 4:25</ref></char></note>Pa bay manti a youn lòt, akoz ke nou te mete sou kote ansyen moun nan avèk abitid mechan li yo, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:24">Ef 4:24</ref></char></note>mete sou nou nouvo moun nan k ap renouvle a yon vrè konesans selon imaj a Kreyatè, li. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Yon renouvèlman konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Wo 10:12</ref></char></note>pa gen distenksyon antre Grèk ak Jwif, sikonsi ak ensikonsi, ni moun Scythe, esklav, ak moun lib, men Kris se tout bagay, e nan tout bagay.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Konsa, tankou sila ki te chwazi pa Bondye yo, ki sen ak byeneme, mete sou nou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22">Gal 5:22</ref></char></note>kè konpasyon, tandrès <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Ef 4:2</ref></char></note>imilite, jantiyès, ak pasyans; <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />ki sipòte youn lòt e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Ef 4:32</ref></char></note>padone youn lòt. Nenpòt moun ki gen plent kont yon lòt; jis jan ke Senyè a te padone nou an, se menm jan an nou dwe fè l tou.<verse eid="COL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Anplis de tout bagay sa yo, mete sou nou lanmou, ki se bon kòl pou konplete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:23">Jn 17:23</ref></char></note>inite a. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:27">Jn 14:27</ref></char></note>lapè Kris la renye nan kè nou. Pou li menm, vrèman, nou te rele nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Ef 2:16</ref></char></note>yon sèl kò, e se pou nou rekonesan. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:17">Wo 10:17</ref></char></note>pawòl a Kris la rete an abondans nan nou, avèk tout sajès nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:28">Kol 1:28</ref></char></note>enstwi ak korije youn lòt avèk sòm, kantik, ak chan lespri yo, k ap chante avèk rekonesans Bondye nan kè nou.<verse eid="COL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:31">I Kor 10:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nenpòt sa nou fè nan pawòl oubyen nan zèv, fè tout bagay nan non Senyè a Jésus, e bay remèsiman atravè Li menm, a Bondye Papa a.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18-4:1">Kol 3:18—4:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Madanm yo, se pou nou soumèt a mari nou, jan sa pwòp a Senyè a.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Ef 5:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mari yo, renmen madanm nou e pa vin fache kont yo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Ef 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zanfan yo, se pou nou obeyisan a paran nou yo nan tout bagay, paske sa fè Senyè a plezi anpil.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Ef 6:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Papa yo, pa fè pitit nou yo fache pou yo pa vin dekouraje.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5">Ef 6:5</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>Esklav yo, nan tout bagay, obeyi a sila ki mèt nou yo sou tè a, pa sèlman avèk yon sèvis ekstèn, jan sila ki sèlman fè moun plezi yo, men avèk yon kè sensè, nan lakrent Senyè a. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Nenpòt sa nou fè, fè travay nou avèk tout kè nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:7">Ef 6:7</ref></char></note>kòmsi se pou Senyè a, olye se pou lòm. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:8">Ef 6:8</ref></char></note>Konnen byen ke nan Senyè a nou va resevwa yon eritaj kòm rekonpans. Se Senyè Kris la ke nou sèvi. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Paske sila ki fè mal la va resevwa konsekans a mal ke li te fè a, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref></char></note>sa, san patipri.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Mèt yo, bay esklav nou yo sa ki jis e rezonab, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Ef 6:9</ref></char></note>konnen ke nou osi gen yon Mèt nan syèl la.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:14">Trav 1:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsakre nou menm a lapriyè. Rete vijilan nan li avèk yon atitid remèsiman. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Priye an menm tan pou nou menm osi, pou Bondye kapab ouvri pou nou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Trav 14:27</ref></char></note>pòt pou pawòl la, pou nou kapab pwoklame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:3">Ef 3:3</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 3:4">4</ref></char></note>mistè a Kris la, akoz se pou li menm, mwen menm osi gen tan anprizone, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />pou m kapab fè li klè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:20">Ef 6:20</ref></char></note>nan fason ke m ta dwe pale a.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:15">Ef 5:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kondwi tèt nou avèk sajès anvè moun deyò yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Ef 5:16</ref></char></note>fè plis ke posib avèk tan an. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:29">Ef 4:29</ref></char></note>Ke pawòl nou yo toujou ranpli ak gras, kòmsi yo te asizonnen avèk sèl, pou nou kapab konnen jan pou nou reponn a chak moun.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:7-9">Kol 4:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Ef 6:21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Pou tout afè mwen yo, Tychique, frè byeneme, sèvitè fidèl ak sèvitè-atache parèy m nan Senyè a, va pote enfòmasyon bannou. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:22">Ef 6:22</ref></char></note>Paske mwen gen tan voye li kote nou eksprè pou rezon sa a, pou nou kapab konnen sikonstans nou yo e pou li kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:2">Kol 2:2</ref></char></note>ankouraje kè nou. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Epi avèk li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10">Phm 10</ref></char></note>Onésime, frè byeneme e fidèl nou an, ki se youn nan nou. Yo va enfòme nou sou tout sitiyasyon an isit la.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristarque, prizonye parèy a mwen an, voye salitasyon bannou; ak Marc, kouzen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Barnabas la, (se sou li, nou te resevwa enstriksyon yo; si li vin kote nou, resevwa l byen). <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Anplis, Jésus ke yo rele Justus la. Sa yo se sèl ouvriye pou wayòm Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:2">Trav 11:2</ref></char></note>ki sòti nan sikonsizyon an, e yo te ankouraje mwen anpil.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Épaphras, ki se youn nan nou, yon sèvitè-atache nèt a Jésus Kri, voye salitasyon bannou. Li ap toujou batay rèd pou nou nan priyè li yo, pou nou kapab kanpe konplè e byen asire nan tout volonte Bondye a. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Paske mwen fè temwayaj li, ke li gen yon gwo sousi pou nou ak pou sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:1">Kol 2:1</ref></char></note>Laodicée ak Hiérapolis yo. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:11">II Tim 4:11</ref></char></note>Luc, doktè byeneme a, voye salitasyon li bannou, e Démas tou. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Salye frè ki Laodicée yo e osi Nymphas ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:5">Wo 16:5</ref></char></note>legliz ki lakay li a. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Lè lèt sa a li pami nou, kite yo li l osi nan legliz Lawodiseyen yo; e nou menm, pou pati pa nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:27">I Tes 5:27</ref></char></note>li lèt mwen an k ap vini soti Laodicée a. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Epi di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Phm 2</ref></char></note>Archippe, “Byen okipe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:5">II Tim 4:5</ref></char></note>èv ke nou te resevwa nan Senyè a, pou nou kapab akonpli li”.<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mwen, Paul, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:7">Fil 1:7</ref></char></note>ekri salitasyon sa a avèk pwòp men mwen. Sonje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">I Kor 16:21</ref></char></note>chenn mwen yo. Ke lagras avèk nou.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>